        "en": "Shion"
      },
      "speakerCharacterId": "shion",
      "text": {
        "ja": "私のおすすめ……ですか？それなら、この短編集が読みやすくて素敵ですよ。",
        "en": "My recommendation...? In that case, this short story collection is wonderfully written."
      },
      "avatars": {
        "shion": {
